"<div class=\"sphx-glr-thumbcontainer\" tooltip=\"A 3-D bar plot can be "
"created from any collection of three-dimensional tabular data. The data "
"points can lie on a regular grid or be irregularly scattered. A special case "
"is creating such a 3-D bar plot based on a grid. This can be done in two "
"steps:\">"
